HTML — Creates the FAQ structure.

CSS — Styles the accordion and makes it responsive.
JavaScript — Adds the click functionality.
const — Declares a variable that cannot be reassigned.

document.querySelectorAll() — Selects all HTML elements matching a CSS selector.

forEach() — Loops through each selected question.

addEventListener() — Runs a function when a click event occurs.

function — Defines a reusable block of code that performs a task.

parentElement — Gets the parent HTML element of the clicked question.

querySelector() — Finds the first matching element inside another element.

classList.toggle() — Adds a CSS class if absent or removes it if present.

classList.contains() — Checks whether an element has a particular CSS class.

textContent — Changes the text displayed inside an HTML element.
